NAMED EXTERNAL IDEAS AS PACKET FIELDS
  Bring radical: keep degree-five branch/monodromy data; do not pretend radicals close the packet.
  Schwarz-Christoffel: endpoint-owner support is the accessory parameter of the contact polygon.
  Barban-Davenport-Halberstam: residue-only failure is a fiber-variance signal, killed by owner support here.
  Menger cuts: minimal owner cuts separate mixed theorem exits in residue fibers.
  Ramanujan-Soldner: useful only as a signed-current zero template, not as a raw constant.
  Sophie Germain identity: factor quartic phi4 debt into quadratic gates when the quartic route is active.
  Hermite-Lindemann-Weierstrass: transcendence shadows need side conditions before algebraic compression.
  Krasner: owner-support persistence should become a p-adic/Hensel stability radius.
  Meissel-Mertens: loglog channel budgets need the constant term only after packet labels are retained.

