CONCLUSION
  HYP-3406 makes owner support the next exact enlarged-bank repair.
  The best new concrete route is an endpoint-owner Menger cut theorem:
    every residue-mixed theorem-exit fiber has a small owner-support cut,
    and recursive/chiral owner signatures explain the growing 26/40/54 families.
  The Bring/SC/BDH/Krasner/Mertens/HLW/Sophie-Germain ideas are useful only
    after translation into packet fields with destroyed-coordinate guardrails.
